		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour, </p><p>J&#039;ai créer une db test sur postgresql et je n&#039;arrive pas à la lier sur java.</p><p>Voici mon code d&#039;initialisation : </p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> private void init(){
		  db_username = &quot;admin&quot;;
		  db_password = &quot;password&quot;;
		  db_url = &quot;jdbc:postgresql://192.168.2.2:5432/test&quot;;
		  db_driver = &quot;org.postgresql.Driver&quot;;
		  db_poolconnection =5;
	 }</code></pre></div><p>et le message d&#039;erreur :</p><p>juin 09, 2018 4:08:45 PM org.postgresql.Driver connect<br />GRAVE: Connection error: <br />org.postgresql.util.PSQLException: La tentative de connexion a échoué.<br />&#160; &#160; at org.postgresql.core.v3.ConnectionFactoryImpl.openConnectionImpl(ConnectionFactoryImpl.java:275)<br />&#160; &#160; at org.postgresql.core.ConnectionFactory.openConnection(ConnectionFactory.java:49)<br />&#160; &#160; at org.postgresql.jdbc.PgConnection.&lt;init&gt;(PgConnection.java:194)<br />&#160; &#160; at org.postgresql.Driver.makeConnection(Driver.java:450)<br />&#160; &#160; at org.postgresql.Driver.connect(Driver.java:252)<br />&#160; &#160; at java.sql.DriverManager.getConnection(DriverManager.java:664)<br />&#160; &#160; at java.sql.DriverManager.getConnection(DriverManager.java:247)<br />&#160; &#160; at serverStructure.connectionPool.ConnectionDB.createNewConnectionForPool(ConnectionDB.java:152)<br />&#160; &#160; at serverStructure.connectionPool.ConnectionDB.initializeConnectionPool(ConnectionDB.java:106)<br />&#160; &#160; at serverStructure.connectionPool.ConnectionDB.initialize(ConnectionDB.java:83)<br />&#160; &#160; at serverStructure.connectionPool.ConnectionDB.&lt;init&gt;(ConnectionDB.java:42)<br />&#160; &#160; at serverStructure.connectionPool.SourceDB.&lt;clinit&gt;(SourceDB.java:6)<br />&#160; &#160; at application.Launcher.main(Launcher.java:20)</p><br /><p>J&#039;ai chercher ailleurs sur le net, j&#039;ai trouvé des solutions qui proposaient de verifier les mots de passes les noms de bases etc.. mais ce n&#039;est pas ça .. </p><p>Pourriez-vous m&#039;aider ?</p><p>Merci d&#039;avance <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="smile" /></p>]]></content>
